    <div class="about-body reveal">
      <p>Planning a conference, summit, product launch or community event in Dubai or Koyilandy? We handle the design, the registrations and the media, so your team can focus on your guests.</p>
      <ul class="evs-list">
        <li><b>Event branding.</b> Posters, social media creatives, stage backdrops and LED screen visuals in one consistent look.</li>
        <li><b>Online registration.</b> A branded registration page on this website, confirmation emails and name badges with a QR code.</li>
        <li><b>Check-in at the door.</b> Fast QR check-in on any phone, with live attendance numbers for the organisers and no long queues at the entrance.</li>
        <li><b>Live coverage.</b> Photography, videography, reels and stories published while the event is happening.</li>
        <li><b>After the event.</b> Highlight films, a photo gallery on this page and a recap you can share with sponsors.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We've supported summits, conferences, community programmes and launches. Tell us your date and venue, and we'll plan the branding, the registrations and the coverage together.</p>
